      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERFECT BANDIT (2) is a talented type who boasts a strong winning strike-rate at this distance. Jumped well when winning her last couple. Last start won this track in a handy 22.51 beating Love Over Gold. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. In top form and looks a key chance again. MAGICAL ANG (3) has a strong record this trip with two wins and two placings from five starts. Hit the frame latest (22.78) when third at Gosford in a Grade 5. Looks suited here and can measure up. BOSTON STRONG (8) continued her winning form with another strong run after running them ragged making it four straight, scoring by 2 lengths (22.94) at this track over 401m. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. One of the leading chances again. FRANKLY (6) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
